49:
  title: The Pull of Fate
  lines:
    - Drawn onward by some unseen guide, called by a whisper too soft to hear, %YOU% realized they were gazing up at the statues of the Three Goddesses.
    - The ageless stone figures stared silently ahead, as though the two sides existed in parallel worlds.
    - Yet the strange sensation lingered, like someone taking %YOU%'s hand and guiding %YOU% forward. %YOU% studied the statues and sank into thought.
    - A breeze stirred. A leaf settled into %YOU%'s outstretched palm, its delicate veins seeming to carry a message meant for %YOU%.

# Pray before the Three Goddesses for Byerley Turk to appear
